  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lifesaving Nutrition and WASH Supplies Pipeline</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project ensures uninterrupted access to Ready-to-Use Therapeutic Food (RUTF) for 50,000 children under five suffering from severe acute malnutrition in Sudan, preventing pipeline breaks and supporting famine prevention efforts through UNICEF&#x2019;s integrated response. It will also deliver essential WASH supplies to Darfur that are not available locally.</narrative>
  </description>
